{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Alexandroff 拓扑"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Alexandroff拓扑"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>预序集上的 <strong>Alexandroff 拓扑</strong>是以其向上封闭子集为开集的拓扑.</p>\n<p>一个"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑空间"}},{"Plain":"是 Alexandroff 的当且仅当开集的任意交是开集; 此时其上对应的预序是<strong>特化</strong> (specialization): $x\\leq y$ 当且仅当 $x$ 的每个邻域都包含 $y$, 也即 $x\\in\\overline{\\{y\\}}$, 此时我们称 $x$ 是 $y$ 的一个特化.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与有限空间的关系</h3>\n<p>每个 $T_0$ "},{"Local":{"url":"有限拓扑空间","text":"有限拓扑空间"}},{"Plain":"都是某个偏序集的 Alexandroff 拓扑.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Sierpiński空间","text":"Sierpiński 空间"}},{"Plain":" (作为拓扑空间) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"真值","text":"真值"}},{"Plain":"的偏序集上的 Alexandroff 拓扑.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}